# Configs and manifests

Adapted from awesome-cursorrules manifest-yaml guidance for this repo's
experiment configs and content-addressed artifacts.

- Treat `schemas/*.schema.json` and `sql/*.sql` as interfaces; validate writes.
- Experiment YAMLs under `configs/experiment/`; machine overrides only under
  `configs/local/` (ignored).
- Graph / matrix / static-feature / checkpoint artifacts need manifests with
  hashes, genome build, dimensions/dtype, and export or build command as
  required by `AGENTS.md`.
- Raise on schema or genome-build mismatch; do not silently coerce.
- Prefer editing existing keys over inventing parallel undocumented config trees.
